{
  "title": {
    "en": "Slide Anywhere",
    "zh-Hans": "随处滑铲"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Slide on any ground while running, flat ground, downhill and uphill, with the game's own slide animation, and on landing from a jump. Pick your slide button in the settings: none is set by default.",
    "zh-Hans": "奔跑时可在任意地面上滑铲：平地、下坡和上坡均可，使用游戏自带的滑铲动作；跳跃落地时也能滑铲。请在设置中选择滑铲按键：默认未设置。"
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "settings": [
    {
      "key": "Enabled",
      "type": "toggle",
      "label": {
        "en": "Enabled",
        "zh-Hans": "启用"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Off: the mod does nothing and no slide starts. A slide under way stops at once.",
        "zh-Hans": "关闭：模组不再生效，不会触发滑铲。正在进行的滑铲会立即停止。"
      },
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "key": "SlideButton",
      "type": "choice",
      "label": {
        "en": "Slide: controller",
        "zh-Hans": "滑铲：手柄"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "The controller button that slides while you run, or just before you land from a jump. Press it again to stop the slide. None by default: pick one to use the mod. The game's own action on that button still happens too: to avoid a clash, pick one the game does not use, or move that action in the game's controls or with a remapping mod.",
        "zh-Hans": "奔跑时，或跳跃落地前一瞬按下即可滑铲的手柄按键。再按一次可停止滑铲。默认未设置：请选择一个按键才能使用本模组。该按键在游戏中原有的功能也会同时触发：为避免冲突，请选择游戏未使用的按键，或在游戏的按键设置中或用改键模组把该功能移到其他按键上。"
      },
      "default": "None",
