    {
      "key": "SlideHold",
      "type": "toggle",
      "label": {
        "en": "Hold to keep sliding",
        "zh-Hans": "按住持续滑铲"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "On: a press still gives the normal slide, and holding the slide button instead keeps the slide going with its speed: steady on flat ground, faster downhill, slower uphill, until a slope slows it to running speed. Let go and the slide stops. In the air, hold the button as you land to slide.",
        "zh-Hans": "开启：按一下仍是普通滑铲；改为按住滑铲键，滑铲会保持速度持续进行：平地上速度不变，下坡加速，上坡减速，直到坡度让速度降到奔跑速度为止。松开即停止滑铲。在空中时，落地的同时按住按键即可滑铲。"
      },
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "key": "SlideSpeed",
      "type": "choice",
      "slider": true,
      "label": {
        "en": "Slide speed",
        "zh-Hans": "滑铲速度"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "How fast you slide. 1.0 is the mod's own speed, 3.0 three times as fast at the start. The slide lasts as long and still ends at running speed, so faster slides go farther.",
        "zh-Hans": "滑铲的速度。1.0 为模组原有速度，3.0 为起步时的三倍速度。滑铲持续时间不变，结束时仍回到奔跑速度，因此速度越高，滑得越远。"
      },
      "default": "1.0",
