    {
      "key": "SlideLength",
      "type": "choice",
      "slider": true,
      "label": {
        "en": "Slide length",
        "zh-Hans": "滑铲时长"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "How long you slide. 1.0 is the mod's own length, 3.0 three times as long and about three times as far on flat ground. Uphill, the slope still slows you down. With Hold to keep sliding, a slide you hold lasts as long as you hold the button.",
        "zh-Hans": "滑铲持续的时间。1.0 为模组原有时长，3.0 为三倍时长，在平地上滑行距离也约为三倍。上坡时，坡度仍会让你减速。开启“按住持续滑铲”时，按住的滑铲持续到松开按键为止。"
